<table><caption>What must this read support?</caption><thead><tr><th>Application need</th><th>Read choice</th><th>What still needs checking</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Check conditions and create a purchase</td><td>A current transaction, normally Serializable</td><td>The whole invariant and retry protocol</td></tr>
